WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:05.950
Open Support, and click New ticket.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:14.450
Choose the department, and the service your question is about.

3
00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:17.444
Write a short subject, and describe what you're seeing.

4
00:00:17.444 --> 00:00:30.250
Then submit the ticket.

5
00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:42.200
You can open the ticket any time to read our replies, and answer in the reply box.
